# packing.vtu is regenerated by run.sh (also matched by the repo-root
# **/*.vtu rule). packing.dat is intentionally NOT ignored: it is committed
# as a small, deterministic precomputed result so readers can inspect the
# packing without running aggregate first.
packing.vtu

